  :test-verification "All 454 Motoi + 603 Sakura tests pass — no regressions, 106 new tests for R7RS coverage."
  :source-first-adherence "PASS — every add lands as (1) reference paragraph in Appendix Z / Section 8, (2) code in r7rs-completions.js, (3) test in test file. Sakura inherits reference via explicit Section 8 statement; no dual-authoring drift risk."
